  "description": "Nena has never been able to dream. When the people of her village, Glen Hollow, begin falling ill after experiencing the same nightmare, only Nena can set out to find a mage powerful enough to save her home. On her first dangerous venture into the unknown, she'll join hands with a narcoleptic bandit, a sleepless mercenary, a nightmare-tormented bard, and a lonely daughter (just like herself) to face a merciless queen and her allegiant sons.\nSource: Tapas",
